title: Matisse would give himself a constraint
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<<<
Matisse would give himself a constraint (the same subject matter, the same color palette) allowing him to focus on variation in technique. Why worry about composition or subject matter if you want to focus on something else altogether?
<<<